## Adapted exercises from S-L-A-K-E-R

The six exercise sheets included in this project are based on original exercises from S-L-A-K-E-R's `EXERCISES/LAB_GENERAL/` directory in the C_courses repository:

https://github.com/1KuMo/C_courses

The original material is licensed under CC BY 4.0 to the extent that S-L-A-K-E-R holds the rights to license it. The exercise sheets in this project have been adapted and reformatted into bilingual study materials.

Please credit S-L-A-K-E-R when reusing the adapted exercises, link to the original source and this license, and indicate that changes were made.

